			"name": "Combat Drug: Hypex",
			"local_notes": "One dose per combat. Enable the trait for the fight; lasts the whole fight (about ten minutes at most). Roll HT after the fight ends; on a failure lose 1 FP and take -1 on all rolls for an hour (the comedown).\n\nLore: Hypex is the drug of the charging Wych: raw speed for crossing a killing field. Background: Codex: Drukhari's Wych Cult drug list.\n\nDesign: Modest; +2 Move on a base of 10-12. Net 7 - 5 = 2 points when enabled.",
