							"local_notes": "One dose per combat; effect lasts the fight, then the comedown. Does not stack with Power from Pain Stage I's High Pain Threshold.",
							"cost_adj": "-30%"
						}
					],
					"base_points": 10
				},
				{
					"id": "t_yS0qxB8qOc8_Saj",
					"name": "Dependency (Painbringer)",
					"reference": "B130",
					"local_notes": "Roll HT after the fight ends; on a failure lose 1 FP and take -1 on all rolls for an hour (the comedown). The wounds it ignored still count: track HP as normal.\n\nLore: Combat drugs are habit-forming; regular users need a dose or suffer the comedown.\n\nDesign: Dependency (B130), a Common substance in Commorragh, milder than Soul Thirst, priced at -5 as a judgement on B130's method.",
					"tags": [
						"Disadvantage",
						"Physical",
