			"name": "Combat Drug: Serpentin",
			"local_notes": "One dose per combat. Enable the trait for the fight; lasts the whole fight (about ten minutes at most). Roll HT after the fight ends; on a failure lose 1 FP and take -1 on all rolls for an hour (the comedown).\n\nLore: Serpentin is the drug that adds force to the arm, favoured by the Wych Cults' bruisers. Background: Codex: Drukhari's Wych Cult drug list; tabletop effect is +1 Strength.\n\nDesign: Damage, not accuracy. Net 7 - 5 = 2 points when enabled.",
