					"local_notes": "Striking ST +2: melee damage as if ST 2 higher.\n\nLore: A muscle-stimulant that adds force to every blow.\n\nDesign: Striking ST 2 (B88, 5/level, 10 points) with the one-dose Accessibility: 7 points.",
