					"id": "tSuvp52zbWdFknfDz",
					"name": "Dependency (Splintermind)",
					"reference": "B130",
					"local_notes": "Roll HT after the fight ends; on a failure lose 1 FP and take -1 on all rolls for an hour (the comedown).\n\nLore: Combat drugs are habit-forming; regular users need a dose or suffer the comedown.\n\nDesign: Dependency (B130), a Common substance in Commorragh, milder than Soul Thirst, priced at -5 as a judgement on B130's method.",
					"tags": [
						"Disadvantage",
						"Physical",
						"Xenos",
