					],
					"base_points": -5
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "T_x1OwwOWPMsmNQQP",
			"name": "Kabalite Conditioning",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The rank-and-file Kabalite is a raider, not a militiaman: as fast and precise as any Guardian but with a lower threshold for fear, kept in line by a mix of loot, terror and the Archon's favour. Codex: Drukhari background.\n\nDesign: Net -5 points. A Kabalite's edge over a Guardian is the raid's training, not the body.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Physical",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari"
			],
			"container_type": "meta_trait",
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "tI62gH5cJaYee3F0p",
					"name": "Attribute Modifiers (Kabalite)",
					"local_notes": "Design: Framework target over the Drukhari Physiology + Keen Battle-Sense baseline: ST 10, DX 14, IQ 12, HT 10, Per 13 (delivered by Keen Battle-Sense), Will 11. Lowered Will -1 (B16, -5/level, -5): a rank-and-file raider's nerve is thinner than an Aeldari Guardian's, cowed by the Kabal's own cruelty rather than steeled by a Path. Nothing else is bought.",
					"tags": [
						"Physical"
					],
					"base_points": -5,
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "will",
							"amount": -1
						}
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "TALAkqXkUrzsh2lvR",
			"name": "Kabal Lens",
			"local_notes": "Lore: The Kabals are the Drukhari's warlord courts: an Archon at the top, Kabalites beneath in ranks, all loyalty conditional on results. Codex: Drukhari and Codex: Dark Eldar background.\n\nDesign: Net -4 points: a perk for drilled fire-discipline against the constant scheming that is the rest of a Kabal's culture. Used by Kabalite Warriors and Archons (enabled).",
			"tags": [
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari"
			],
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "tJ7YKKj-Bv7n6XB05",
					"name": "Raid Drill",
					"reference": "B100",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Splinter-rifle volley drill in the Kabal's own raid formations.\n\nDesign: Perk (B100), +1 to Guns (Rifle).",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Xenos",
						"Drukhari"
					],
					"base_points": 1,
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "skill_bonus",
							"selection_type": "skills_with_name",
							"name": {
								"compare": "is",
								"qualifier": "Guns"
							},
							"amount": 1,
							"specialization": {
								"compare": "is",
								"qualifier": "Rifle"
							}
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"id": "t3Y0ykjZ_jyDgdBuz",
					"name": "Kabal Politics",
					"reference": "B153",
					"local_notes": "Selfish as above (a lens-level reminder: the Kabal's loyalty is bought and rescinded).\n\nLore: A Kabalite climbs by advancing at others' expense.\n\nDesign: Selfish (B153, -5), self-control 12.",
					"tags": [
						"Disadvantage",
						"Mental",
						"Xenos",
						"Drukhari"
					],
					"base_points": -5,
					"cr": 12
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "T12OnjgFkAFHHBE06",
			"name": "Wych Training",
			"local_notes": "Lore: What the Wych Cults' arena training does to a Kabalite-grade body: years of mock-battles on razor-strewn floors and blood-sport fights on death-trap arenas, turning a raider into a fighting dancer whose skill is dodge, not armour. Codex: Drukhari's Wych Cult background.\n\nDesign: 70 + 30 + 15 = 115 points, added to the Drukhari Physiology + Keen Battle-Sense baseline (145 + 5 = 150) for 265 points before cult lens, mental traits and skills.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
				"Physical",
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari"
			],
			"container_type": "meta_trait",
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "t58stzCM97iVc8sRt",
					"name": "Attribute Modifiers (Wych)",
					"local_notes": "Design: Framework target over the Drukhari Physiology + Keen Battle-Sense baseline: ST 11, DX 16, IQ 12, HT 11, Per 13, Will 12 (both untouched), Move 12. ST +1 (B14, 10) for arena-honed muscle; DX +2 (B15, 20/level, 40) to DX 16, matching an Aspect Warrior's; HT +1 (B15, 10); Basic Move +2 (B17, 5/level, 10) so a Wych (Move 12) crosses the arena as fast as an Aspect Warrior. 10 + 40 + 10 + 10 = 70 points.",
					"tags": [
						"Physical"
					],
					"base_points": 70,
					"features": [
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "st",
							"amount": 1
						},
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "dx",
							"amount": 2
						},
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "ht",
							"amount": 1
						},
						{
							"type": "attribute_bonus",
							"attribute": "basic_move",
							"amount": 2
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"id": "tXfo83p33T21dh4HQ",
					"name": "Enhanced Dodge",
					"reference": "B51",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Wych fights in almost no armour, so evasion is her defence: framework.md calls her 'drug-fuelled acrobat; dodge is her armour'. Two levels rather than the Aspect Warrior's one because that is all she has.\n\nDesign: Enhanced Dodge 2 (B51, 15/level, 30 points): Dodge 12 at Basic Speed 7.0 (7 + 3 + 2).",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Physical",
						"Xenos",
						"Drukhari"
					],
					"points_per_level": 15,
					"can_level": true,
					"levels": 2
				},
				{
					"id": "tfLVr_TRSzwNGgSGt",
					"name": "Perfect Balance",
					"reference": "B74",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Arena acrobats fight on ropes, spinning blades and moving platforms; the balance is the profession.\n\nDesign: Perfect Balance (B74, 15 points): bonuses to balance and to Acrobatics as the book lists them; it does not by itself add to Dodge.",
					"tags": [
						"Advantage",
						"Physical",
						"Xenos",
						"Drukhari"
					],
					"base_points": 15
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": "Tiu5_Yu9frByv-9FQ",
			"name": "Wych Cult Lens",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Wych Cults are Commorragh's gladiatorial societies: each arena fight is both sport and sacrifice, fed by drugs and worshipped by the crowd. Codex: Drukhari and Codex: Dark Eldar background. The cult's combat drugs are the six separate Combat Drug traits, disabled by default on each cult template.\n\nDesign: Net +2 points: two perks for what the arena gives every Wych, on top of the Wych Training package.",
			"tags": [
				"Xenos",
				"Drukhari"
			],
			"children": [
				{
					"id": "tVDr5cqhvRCqkauuc",
					"name": "Arena Poise",
					"reference": "B100",
					"local_notes": "Lore: An arena fighter's flourish is part of the fight.\n\nDesign: Perk (B100), +1 to Acrobatics.",
					"tags": [
						"Perk",
						"Xenos",
						"Drukhari"
					],
					"base_points": 1,
