					"local_notes": "Design: Framework target over the Wych + Keen Battle-Sense baseline: ST 12, DX 18, IQ 13, HT 12, Per 14 (IQ 13 plus Keen Battle-Sense), Will 14 (IQ 13 plus 1), Move 12. ST +1 (B14, 10), DX +2 (B15, 40) to DX 18, IQ +1 (B16, 20), HT +1 (B15, 10), Will +1 (B16, 5): 85 points.",
