					"name": "Enhanced Dodge",
					"reference": "B51",
					"local_notes": "Lore: An arena queen out-dodges her own Wyches.\n\nDesign: A further Enhanced Dodge 1 (B51, 15 points), stacking with Wych Training's two for Enhanced Dodge 3.",
