				{
					"id": "tGhUeJUwm7swneiYs",
					"name": "Weapon Master (Arena Weapon)",
					"reference": "B99",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Succubus's signature weapon (agoniser, razorflails, hydra gauntlets or shardnet) is the one she has refought a thousand times.\n\nDesign: Weapon Master, one weapon (B99, 20 points).",
