		{
			"id": "TgYLakJ-eVEjsxdYz",
			"name": "Haemonculus's Self-Sculpted Body",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Haemonculi are the flesh-sculptors of the Covens and their own first works: bodies rebuilt over centuries into whatever shape their art demanded. Codex: Drukhari's Haemonculus background.\n\nDesign: 135 + 10 + 4 + 10 + 6 + 5 - 20 = 150 points, added to the baseline (145) for 295 points before regrowth, estate, mental traits and skills.",
			"tags": [
				"Advantage",
