					"id": "t8Y9_VssSB_LheXw3",
					"name": "Attribute Modifiers (Haemonculus)",
					"local_notes": "Design: Framework target over the Drukhari Physiology baseline: ST 13, DX 13, IQ 16, HT 15, HP 18, Per 14, Will 17, Move 8. ST +3 (B14, 30); DX -1 (B15, -20); IQ +4 (B16, 80); HT +5 (B15, 50); HP +5 (B16, 2/level, 10; 13 ST plus 5 = 18); Per -2 (B16, 5/level, -10; IQ 16 to Per 14: the Haemonculus is more focused on the inner than the outer world); Will +1 (B16, 5; IQ 16 to Will 17); Basic Move -2 (B17, -5/level, -10; Basic Speed 7.25 gives Basic Move 7, plus 3, minus 2 = 8; a ponderous, heavily-modified gait). 30 - 20 + 80 + 50 + 10 - 10 + 5 - 10 = 135 points.",
					"tags": [
