					"name": "Injury Tolerance (No Vitals)",
					"reference": "B60",
					"local_notes": "Lore: A Haemonculus's vital organs are moved, doubled or spread through the body.\n\nDesign: Injury Tolerance, No Vitals (B60, 5 points): vitals hits count as torso hits.",
