			"name": "Wrack Surgery",
			"local_notes": "Lore: Wracks are the Covens' servants, taken and rebuilt for labour and torture: bulked out, dulled, and set to the Haemonculus's work. Codex: Drukhari's Wrack background.\n\nDesign: 4 + 10 + 9 + 6 + 6 - 12 = 23 points, added to the baseline (145) for 168 points before mental traits, Power from Pain and skills.",
